{
  "$schema": "./story.schema.json",
  "title": "Thank You For Your Service",
  "acts": [
    {
      "id": "act1",
      "title": "The Food Truck (Building)",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "lines": ["THE FOOD TRUCK", "Est. 2021"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "HIRED AS: Waiter          $4,000",
            "DATE:     Dec 2022",
            "HOURS:    27/week",
            "DUTIES:   Serve food",
            "",
            "          (contract never updated)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You arrive.",
            "",
            "The kitchen is three separate",
            "shacks. One per meal type.",
            "Same ingredients in every shack.",
            "No thermometer.",
            "No recipe book."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Previous cook's actual comment:",
            "",
            "  \"I worked in a Michelin",
            "   kitchen so I don't need",
            "   a thermometer.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["PREVIOUS COOK'S REVIEWS:"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You line up the specials boards.",
            "",
            "  \"You changed existing recipes.",
            "   The rule is not to change",
            "   existing recipes.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You add the first food safety",
            "checklist the kitchen has ever had.",
            "",
            "He argues about whether the",
            "checklist belongs in the kitchen."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Your contributions are sorted",
            "into two piles:",
            "",
            "  ACCEPTED",
            "  CHECK WITH ME FIRST"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["You fix things anyway."]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Consolidated three shacks",
            "into one building.",
            "Added the first thermometer.",
            "Added the first recipe book.",
            "Organized the walk-in.",
            "",
            "Revenue goes up."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["Previous cook fired."]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["What he left behind:"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "A stock order that throws out",
            "the entire pantry.",
            "Hours before a tasting."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Portion sizes that say \"zero\"",
            "when they mean \"we don't",
            "stock this.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["An oven timer set to 57 days", "instead of minutes."]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You now cook, serve, clean,",
            "and maintain. Alone.",
            "For 6 months.",
            "No backup. No support.",
            "Complete ownership."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "STAFF:                        1",
            "DUTIES:   Everything",
            "DURATION: 6 months",
            "BACKUP:   None"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "RAISE:              $200/month",
            "  (for absorbing an entire role)",
            "",
            "ORIGINAL CONTRACT:",
            "  ROLE:   Waiter",
            "  PAY:    $4,000",
            "  NOW:    $4,200"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Sommelier and busser arrive.",
            "Relief.",
            "",
            "But you already own everything.",
            "They don't touch the kitchen.",
            "You don't stop."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["THE WHOLESALE MENU"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Owner promises clients the",
            "kitchen will start catering.",
            "Every recipe, packaged for",
            "other restaurants to buy."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "YOU: \"If we just expand the",
            "  takeout window, we'll have to",
            "  hand-deliver custom platters",
            "  to each client. And change",
            "  them whenever they ask.",
            "",
            "  One menu they can all order",
            "  from makes more sense.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["OWNER: \"I think this is the", "  way to go.\""]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["Assigns you to build it."]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["PRIORITY: Build catering menu"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["PRIORITY CHANGED:", "  Fix the freezer first"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["PRIORITY CHANGED:", "  Actually, catering menu first"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["PRIORITY CHANGED:", "  Add bar appetizers"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "PRIORITY CHANGED:",
            "  Catering menu. Clients",
            "  are crowding me."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["(4 priority changes in 12 days.)"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"I'm having issues with",
            "  your reliability on this stuff\"",
            "",
            "OWNER: \"You're not accomplishing",
            "  work swiftly\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "YOU: \"We have 3 part-time cooks.",
            "  Being a catering operation",
            "  is going to be brutal.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["Team hears \"brutal.\""]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "SOMMELIER: \"Just expand the",
            "  existing takeout window.\"",
            "BUSSER: seconds it.",
            "OWNER: agrees."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["YOU: \"That's the same work", "  with a worse result.\""]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["Owner calls you.", "Agrees again."]
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "id": "dish",
          "options": ["Build it right", "Simplify"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "variant": "Build it right",
          "lines": ["You build the real thing."]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "variant": "Simplify",
          "lines": ["You can't build it halfway.", "You build the real thing."]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "It becomes the biggest revenue",
            "source. Six restaurant chains",
            "now buy from your kitchen.",
            "",
            "No credit. No raise."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "CHRISTMAS BONUS:          $0",
            "PREVIOUS YEAR:        $5,000",
            "EXPLANATION:         (none)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "YOU BUILT: The catering menu",
            "",
            "OWNER: \"You're the only one",
            "  who could manage to do this\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["THE KITCHEN FIRE"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "WHILE SIMULTANEOUSLY:",
            "  - Building new menu items",
            "  - Replating the appetizers",
            "  - Answering client questions",
            "  - Rolling out new plates Monday",
            "    \"because Reasons\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["1 AM SATURDAY, DURING THE FIRE:"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "YOU:   \"It didn't feel great to",
            "  get $0 when I got $5k the",
            "  previous year.\"",
            "STATUS:              Drunk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"I had a raise ready but",
            "  when you are not delivering it",
            "  is difficult to justify it\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"If we keep at this level",
            "  of efficiency in Feb, I will",
            "  implement something\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "RESULT: 27 hrs → 30 hrs.",
            "  $4,200 → $5,000.",
            "",
            "  Not a raise.",
            "  You were already working 30.",
            "  They started paying for it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "PAY HISTORY:",
            "  Dec 2022:  $4,000  Hired",
            "  Feb 2024:  $4,200  Cook fired,",
            "               you absorbed role",
            "  Feb 2025:  $5,000  Complained",
            "               (already working",
            "               the hours)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "ORIGINAL CONTRACT:",
            "  ROLE:       Waiter",
            "  PAY:        $4,000",
            "  DUTIES:     Serve food",
            "",
            "CURRENT:",
            "  ROLE:       (none given)",
            "  PAY:        $5,000",
            "  DUTIES:     Everything"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["RENOVATION ATTEMPT: New door locks"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "STATUS: 1 month. Learning alone.",
            "  No training. No pair. No review.",
            "  Too scared to install.",
            "  All work scrapped.",
            "  40-day gap.",
            "  Nobody noticed."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "TRAINING PROVIDED:        None",
            "SHADOWING:                None",
            "INSPECTION:               None"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["WASTED EFFORT IS THE MOST", "DEMORALIZING TYPE OF WORK."]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["THE OFFSITE"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"If things don't improve",
            "  in three months, we'll have",
            "  to deal with this somehow.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["You didn't sleep the week", "before that meeting."]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["Things improved.", "No one mentioned it again."]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["3 MONTHS LATER"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER (4:06 PM):",
            "  \"Can we meet today? I want",
            "   to review progress since",
            "   the offsite.\"",
            "  \"(nothing bad)\"",
            "",
            "MEETING:           7:00 PM",
            "NOTICE:            3 hours"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["You survived."]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "SLEEP:           5am bedtimes",
            "CV:              Updated",
            "FEELING:   \"I don't enjoy doing",
            "  it, and it shows.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "DUTIES:",
            "  Serve + Cook + Clean +",
            "  Maintain building +",
            "  Train staff + Fix plumbing +",
            "  Design menu + Handle complaints +",
            "  Learn payment systems alone +",
            "  Fix things at 4am that only",
            "  you know how to fix"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "PAY:                      $5,000",
            "ORIGINAL ROLE:            Waiter",
            "CONTRACT SAYS:   \"Serve food\"",
            "REVENUE:       (dramatically up)"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "act2",
      "title": "The Votes (Losing control)",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "lines": ["PROPOSALS"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["VACATION INTERRUPTION"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You're on vacation.",
            "",
            "Sommelier rearranges the",
            "dining room on Saturday.",
            "Something breaks.",
            "",
            "He puts back ALL the old plates.",
            "Including the ones in",
            "the back office."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Sunday evening: DM from",
            "another staff member.",
            "Broken plates.",
            "Caused by what the sommelier undid."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "PERSONAL TIME VIOLATIONS:    2",
            "OVER:            1 weekend",
            "STATUS:          On vacation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["CLOTH NAPKINS"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You propose cloth napkins.",
            "One-month trial.",
            "Documented benefits.",
            "Exit criteria if it doesn't work."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "options": ["Submit", "Don't bother"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "BUSSER: \"I never paid attention",
            "  to the napkins.\"",
            "",
            "Busser votes no."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "SOMMELIER: \"I have a",
            "  certification in table setting.\"",
            "",
            "Sommelier votes no."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["OWNER: \"We're torturing", "  the sommelier.\""]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"Imagine if a food critic",
            "  rejected your restaurant",
            "  for a typo on the menu.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [">>> DENIED <<<"]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["3 days later:"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "SOMMELIER (DM):",
            "  Fixed 5 napkin folds today.",
            "  Updated the napkin count.",
            "  \"I also LOVE folding",
            "   napkins!\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "The system worked on him.",
            "He couldn't tolerate someone",
            "else having the authority",
            "to require it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["THE TWO SOMMELIERS"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "SOMMELIER (DM, to you):",
            "  \"You put super hard work into",
            "   making the food really good.",
            "   I've been here 20 years. Our",
            "   food's really good. And I think",
            "   you are my main reason",
            "   behind that.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "SOMMELIER (team meeting,",
            "  1 hour later):",
            "  \"Super disrespectful.\"",
            "  \"I have a certification.\"",
            "  Votes no."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["FIX THE WOBBLY TABLE"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Table wobbles. Customers complain.",
            "You build a replacement in 1 hour."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "options": ["Submit", "Don't bother"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["OWNER: \"I'm 100% sold on", "  this table.\""]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"Can you wobble-proof",
            "  the old one for a week first?\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["OWNER: \"I don't care if you", "  spend a week on it.\""]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"If you really don't",
            "  want to look at this, I could",
            "  always get another cook.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You asked if the table was",
            "actually wobbling.",
            "Standard verification before",
            "spending a week on it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["OWNER: \"I feel a little", "  gaslighted.\""]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [">>> DEFERRED <<<"]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["LIMIT THE ORDERS"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Catering clients are ordering",
            "faster than the kitchen can cook.",
            "",
            "One client orders the entire",
            "menu at once. Kitchen grinds",
            "to a halt."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["You build portion limits.", "Ready to turn on."]
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "options": ["Submit", "Don't bother"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["OWNER: \"Let me call each", "  client first.\""]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [">>> DEFERRED <<<"]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Kitchen backs up again.",
            "",
            "Staff tries to slow the wrong",
            "client. The one causing it",
            "keeps ordering."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "YOU:   Wrong client = 1%",
            "       Actual problem = 89.5%",
            "       They limited the wrong one."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [">>> DEFERRED <<<"]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Kitchen backs up AGAIN.",
            "",
            "Owner can't check the orders.",
            "\"Let's discuss Thursday.\"",
            "Owner cancels Thursday."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "LIMITS:          Ready since Mar 17",
            "CURRENT STATUS:  Watch and wait",
            "REASON:     Owner wants to call",
            "            each client first",
            "CLIENTS:                ~30",
            "CALLS MADE:               3",
            "KITCHEN BACKUPS SINCE:    3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [">>> DEFERRED <<<"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [">>> DEFERRED <<<"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [">>> DEFERRED <<<"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Owner cancels the meeting where",
            "you'd discuss the limits.",
            "Assigns napkin work instead."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"It's very tiring for me",
            "  psychologically and it really",
            "  ruins my day.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Meanwhile, sommelier copies",
            "the entire recipe binder",
            "for the client who keeps",
            "ordering too much."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"I think in the future",
            "  we will do that. It's gonna",
            "  take too long with the new",
            "  portion limits.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"I've run into this with",
            "  you where there's stuff I want",
            "  to do and you're really",
            "  nervous about.\"",
            "  (You own the schedule. You",
            "  said the schedule will break.)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"Strong dog on a leash.\"",
            "  (About your productivity.)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "JAN 2023: \"I really see you as",
            "  the head chef here.\"",
            "",
            "MAR 2026: (Described the role.",
            "  Did not offer it.)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"I'm not a big kind of",
            "  like this person is the boss",
            "  of this person.\"",
            "  (Three years. No title.",
            "  No authority. Same duties.)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "OWNER: \"We are getting into too",
            "  many of these deep, complex",
            "  discussions.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "PROPOSALS SUBMITTED:          3",
            "DENIED:                       1",
            "DEFERRED:                     2",
            "APPROVED:                     0"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "act3",
      "title": "The New Hire (Double standard)",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "lines": ["NEW STAFF"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "KITCHEN CONSULTANT       $$$",
            "DUTIES:    Whatever he wants",
            "APPROVAL:  Not required",
            "NAPKINS:   Not discussed"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Consultant arrives.",
            "",
            "Chooses own suppliers.",
            "Own furniture. Own plates.",
            "No team discussion.",
            "No show of hands."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You wrote the blueprint for",
            "his pop-up location.",
            "",
            "Owner dismissed it as",
            "\"a food truck with a",
            "clipboard.\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": ["Consultant built exactly", "what you designed."]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You proposed new plates:",
            "  >>> NEEDS TEAM VOTE",
            "",
            "Consultant ordered new plates:",
            "  >>> INSTALLED"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
